{"3850670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HAUNTED: Escape the Dollhouse", "steam_appid": 3850670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An asymmetrical co-op puzzle game for 2–4 players. One player investigates a mysterious dollhouse while their friends are trapped inside it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share clues, solve occult puzzles, and try not to panic when your friends give terrible directions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized rooms, puzzles, and supernatural threats ensure that no two investigations are alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/c8b984c49272d974ed21df1ffc3a1c0e.poster.avif?t=1782261484\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/c8b984c49272d974ed21df1ffc3a1c0e.webm?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/c8b984c49272d974ed21df1ffc3a1c0e.mp4?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/fed44b8a70e63ca575f3be945a405e97.avif?t=1782261484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras_big/fed44b8a70e63ca575f3be945a405e97.webp?t=1782261484 width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player investigates a mysterious dollhouse from the outside while up to three friends explore its life-sized rooms from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The catch?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody has all the answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clues you need are always in somebody else's hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/bc5f7cd69ead594c619a28eb1ddacace.poster.avif?t=1782261484\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/bc5f7cd69ead594c619a28eb1ddacace.webm?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/bc5f7cd69ead594c619a28eb1ddacace.mp4?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/e00d80b157167faa0ab8a4004f3af2a6.avif?t=1782261484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras_big/e00d80b157167faa0ab8a4004f3af2a6.webp?t=1782261484 width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll argue over clues. Misread ancient rituals. Accidentally send your friends into danger and turn simple tasks into complete chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then do it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on teamwork, communication, and occasionally listening to the friend everyone else stopped listening to ten minutes ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/1ffc0bf3041d399f139c01a37004e4ff.poster.avif?t=1782261484\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/1ffc0bf3041d399f139c01a37004e4ff.webm?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/1ffc0bf3041d399f139c01a37004e4ff.mp4?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/70f696d17c98b78f38e69b09c1904c80.avif?t=1782261484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras_big/70f696d17c98b78f38e69b09c1904c80.webp?t=1782261484 width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each investigation lasts around 30–40 minutes and is designed to be replayed with friends again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms change. Puzzles change. Supernatural events change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every trip into the dollhouse presents new challenges, forcing your team to adapt, communicate, and think on their feet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only constant is your friends giving terrible advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the longer you stay inside the dollhouse, <u>the stronger the curse becomes.</u> Find the answers you need before it claims your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/89f639657a0c12d84302875e04e74741.poster.avif?t=1782261484\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/89f639657a0c12d84302875e04e74741.webm?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/89f639657a0c12d84302875e04e74741.mp4?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/1a838357d1fd082e4e307271e3db736d.avif?t=1782261484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras_big/1a838357d1fd082e4e307271e3db736d.webp?t=1782261484 width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Sight, your paranormal ability to uncover hidden clues, reveal secrets, and navigate the strange forces at work inside the dollhouse. Complete investigations to earn XP and Soul Tokens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities, strengthen your supernatural senses, and discover new ways to help your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/ec128ba3028b01cad550838d0e237d4a.poster.avif?t=1782261484\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/ec128ba3028b01cad550838d0e237d4a.webm?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/ec128ba3028b01cad550838d0e237d4a.mp4?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/ff1df500dacdc97008ba305b2d2435c5.avif?t=1782261484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras_big/ff1df500dacdc97008ba305b2d2435c5.webp?t=1782261484 width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 2–4 player asymmetrical online co-op — one outside, up to three within</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Chaotic communication-driven gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Race against an ever-growing curse that threatens players trapped inside the dollhouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Randomized rooms, puzzles, and supernatural events every run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Highly replayable 30–40 minute investigations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Progression system: earn XP, unlock abilities, strengthen the Sight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Inspired by escape rooms, paranormal investigations, and occult mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>If you liked Keep Talking and Nobody Explodes or We Were Here — this one's for you!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/f82108805b7f853ac63424523155facb.avif?t=1782261484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras_big/f82108805b7f853ac63424523155facb.webp?t=1782261484 width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the request access button on top of this page: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/1e49d2154106ef90f29a940c374b8c2f.avif?t=1782261484\" width=832 height=676 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An asymmetrical co-op puzzle game for 2–4 players. One player investigates a mysterious dollhouse while their friends are trapped inside it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share clues, solve occult puzzles, and try not to panic when your friends give terrible directions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized rooms, puzzles, and supernatural threats ensure that no two investigations are alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/c8b984c49272d974ed21df1ffc3a1c0e.poster.avif?t=1782261484\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item