/extras_big/e00d80b157167faa0ab8a4004f3af2a6.webp?t=1782261484 width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll argue over clues. Misread ancient rituals. Accidentally send your friends into danger and turn simple tasks into complete chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then do it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on teamwork, communication, and occasionally listening to the friend everyone else stopped listening to ten minutes ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/1ffc0bf3041d399f139c01a37004e4ff.poster.avif?t=1782261484\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/1ffc0bf3041d399f139c01a37004e4ff.webm?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/1ffc0bf3041d399f139c01a37004e4ff.mp4?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/70f696d17c98b78f38e69b09c1904c80.avif?t=1782261484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras_big/70f696d17c98b78f38e69b09c1904c80.webp?t=1782261484 width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each investigation lasts around 30–40 minutes and is designed to be replayed with friends again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms change. Puzzles change. Supernatural events change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every trip into the dollhouse presents new challenges, forcing your team to adapt, communicate, and think on their feet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only constant is your friends giving terrible advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the longer you stay inside the dollhouse, <u>the stronger the curse becomes.</u> Find the answers you need before it claims your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/89f639657a0c12d84302875e04e74741.poster.avif?t=1782261484\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/89f639657a0c12d84302875e04e74741.webm?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/89f639657a0c12d84302875e04e74741.mp4?t=1782261484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/1a838357d1fd082e4e307271e3db736d.avif?t=1782261484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras_big/1a838357d1fd082e4e307271e3db736d.webp?t=1782261484 width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Sight, your paranormal ability to uncover hidden clues, reveal secrets, and navigate the strange forces at work inside the dollhouse. Complete investigations to earn XP and Soul Tokens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities, strengthen your supernatural senses, and discover new ways to help your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/ec128ba3028b01cad550838d0e237d4a.poster.avif?t=1782261484\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850670/extras/ec128ba3028b01